## 7.3 Model 2 — Fixed-Price Service Bundles

The Fixed-Price Service Bundles model provides scope-based pricing for defined professional services. This is Klaud’s recommended model for project delivery because it gives partners predictable pricing, clear deliverables, and a practical way to include Klaud’s services in customer proposals.

Unlike hourly services, fixed-price bundles are not based on the amount of time required to complete the work. They are based on agreed scope, milestones, deliverables, complexity, and project assumptions.

This model is best suited for:

* VCF design and deployment
* VCF workload domain implementation
* VCF upgrades
* VCF migrations
* Technical assessments
* Architecture workshops
* Advanced VMware add-ons
* Disaster recovery implementation
* Security and segmentation initiatives
* Kubernetes enablement
* Rescue or stabilization projects

Final scope must be validated before project commitment.

