### 7.3.8 Bundle Discount Logic

Discounts may apply when multiple add-ons are purchased as part of the same project scope.

| Scenario                           |               Maximum Discount |
| ---------------------------------- | -----------------------------: |
| 1 add-on                           |                             0% |
| 2 add-ons                          |                             5% |
| 3 add-ons                          |                             8% |
| 4 or more add-ons                  |                            10% |
| Strategic partner annual agreement | Up to 12%, subject to approval |

Discounts are not automatic and must be approved as part of the final commercial proposal. Discounts apply only to eligible add-on services and do not apply to emergency support, travel expenses, or already-discounted services unless specifically approved.

