## 7.4 Model 3 — Partner Expert Capacity Plans

Partner Expert Capacity Plans provide prepaid access to Klaud’s senior VMware and private cloud specialists over a defined validity period.

This model is designed for partners that have recurring VMware opportunities, multiple customer environments, or ongoing demand for specialist support but do not want to negotiate a separate statement of work for every activity.

This model gives partners a flexible way to use Klaud’s expertise across different customers, projects, and technical needs.

Klaud may refer to this model commercially as:

# Klaud Expert Bank

### 7.4.1 How Klaud Expert Bank Works

The partner purchases a defined number of expert hours in advance. Those hours can be consumed across eligible activities during the validity period.

This model is suitable for:

* Partners with recurring VMware opportunities
* Partners building a VMware Cloud Foundation practice
* Partners that need pre-sales and delivery support
* Partners that require specialist escalation capacity
* Partners that want predictable access to senior expertise
* Partners that prefer not to negotiate each task separately

