## 7.5 Recommended Model by Scenario

The following table provides general guidance for selecting the most appropriate pricing model.

| Scenario                                                           | Recommended Model                                          |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| New partner wants to validate Klaud’s expertise                    | On-Demand Hourly Services                                  |
| Partner needs help with a pre-sales customer meeting               | On-Demand Hourly Services or Expert Bank                   |
| Partner needs a price to include in a customer proposal            | Fixed-Price Service Bundle                                 |
| Partner has sold a VCF workload domain deployment                  | Fixed-Price Service Bundle                                 |
| Partner needs support with an unclear or undefined technical issue | On-Demand Hourly Services                                  |
| Partner has multiple opportunities in pipeline                     | Expert Bank                                                |
| Partner wants recurring access to senior VMware expertise          | Expert Bank                                                |
| Customer requires a VCF readiness assessment                       | Fixed-Price Service Bundle                                 |
| Customer requires VCF Automation, VKS, NSX Federation, or vDefend  | Fixed-Price Add-On                                         |
| Partner needs urgent rescue support                                | On-Demand Hourly Services or Rescue / Stabilization Sprint |
| Partner wants post-project optimization and advisory support       | Expert Bank                                                |
| Partner wants a predictable fixed price for delivery               | Fixed-Price Service Bundle                                 |

In general:

* Use **On-Demand Hourly Services** when the work is small, urgent, exploratory, or undefined.
* Use **Fixed-Price Service Bundles** when the work has a clear scope, deliverables, and expected outcome.
* Use **Partner Expert Capacity Plans** when the partner needs recurring access to Klaud’s specialist expertise across multiple activities or opportunities.

Klaud can assist partners in selecting the most appropriate pricing model during opportunity qualification or technical discovery.
